crate = "cros-codecs"
version = "0.0.6"
source = "https://crates.io/crates/cros-codecs/0.0.6"

Weld raises the VA-API decoder placeholder context from 16x16 to 64x64 for
radeonsi compatibility, uses Constrained Baseline for that placeholder,
propagates initialization failure through the existing decoder error instead
of panicking, and sets both constraint_set0_flag and constraint_set1_flag in a
Baseline SPS to match the selected Constrained Baseline VA profile. Remove this
path patch when an upstream release contains equivalent behavior.
